2026-07-27T05:37:43.3198473Z Start test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
2026-07-27T05:37:43.3269110Z duckdb keeps downloaded extensions and secrets in a temporary directory:
2026-07-27T05:37:43.3269832Z i /tmp/RtmpoiBBqb/duckdb
2026-07-27T05:37:43.3270577Z This is removed when the R session ends.
2026-07-27T05:37:43.3271172Z * Extensions are re-downloaded each session.
2026-07-27T05:37:43.3272119Z * Secrets are lost.
2026-07-27T05:37:43.3272956Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = TRUE) (or create ~/.duckdb) to keep them (suitable for most users).
2026-07-27T05:37:43.3274141Z i Run duckdb(shared_home = FALSE) to accept the temporary directory (and silence this message).
2026-07-27T05:37:43.3274970Z i See ?duckdb_storage for details and alternatives.
2026-07-27T05:37:43.3521107Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:52:3' [success]
2026-07-27T05:37:43.3634559Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:53:3' [success]
2026-07-27T05:37:43.4080168Z   'test-storage-message-once.R:59:3' [success]
2026-07-27T05:37:43.4257903Z End test: reusing a cached on-disk driver does not record a storage choice
